---
description: Shared pull-request contract for Cursor agents on maharashtra-sachet
alwaysApply: true
---

When you open, update, review, or land a pull request, read and follow `.cursor/skills/pr-setup/SKILL.md`.

Grok Bot is the outer loop. It gathers context and writes the prompt. It does not edit the product patch.

A Cursor cloud agent is the inner loop. It applies that prompt and opens the pull request.

Open every pull request ready, never as a draft. Do not babysit when the pull request opens. Do not merge unless the user explicitly asked to ship, land, or merge.
